    {
      "sectionId": "intro",
      "heading": "Wall Spells: A Practical Guide: DnD 5e",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "blockId": "block-intro-1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "type": "emphasis",
              "text": "When you come to it"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\n\n\n\n"
            },
            {
              "type": "emphasis",
              "text": "And you can’t go through it"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\n\n\n\n"
            },
            {
              "type": "emphasis",
              "text": "And you can’t knock it down"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\n\n\n\n"
            },
            {
              "type": "emphasis",
              "text": "You know that you’ve found"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\n\n\n\n"
            },
            {
              "type": "emphasis",
              "text": "The wall, the wall, the wall"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\n\n\n\n"
            },
            {
              "type": "emphasis",
              "text": "No man on earth can make it fall"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "type": "link",
              "text": "The Wall",
              "href": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VfBFSCjAeWc"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " – Heet Mob"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sectionId": "section-wall-spells-introduction",
      "heading": "Wall Spells Introduction",
      "sourceAnchor": "wall-spells-introduction",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "blockId": "block-section-wall-spells-introduction-1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "One of the greatest contributions of magic upon the battlefield is the power of control. This power brings to mind spells like Black Tentacles, Hold Monster, Hypnotic Pattern, and Web, spells that directly inhibit the enemies or create dangerous zones. These spells certainly have their places in any spellbook, but sometimes such direct methods are insufficient. Sometimes instead of controlling your foes it is better to control their access. Sometimes all you need is a Wall."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blockId": "block-section-wall-spells-introduction-2",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "There are a few different Wall spells, and, while they all have the main function of cutting the battlefield into sections, they can be divided up into a handful of overlapping categories. Some Walls are intended to do damage, some block movement, others inhibit sight or effects; most do some combination of these effects. The other major distinction between different walls is how finely the caster can build the wall, by which we mean “does it have to be one continuous flat surface or can it bend into corners and create hallways?”"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
